* Eurorack to STM32 Anti-Aliasing Input Stage SPICE Simulation
* 
* Circuit Characteristics:
* - Single-supply 3.3V operation (VDD = 3.3V, VSS = 0V)
* - Input: Eurorack 20V peak-to-peak (-10V to +10V bipolar audio signal)
* - Standard E12 series resistors and E6 series capacitors
* - Level-shift to positive range: 0.31V to 3.06V centered at ~1.68V (0 to 3.3V acceptable by STM32 ADC)
* - 2nd-order Sallen-Key low-pass filter (Butterworth characteristic, fc ~ 21.4 kHz)
* - Output RC post-filter (100 ohm E12 + 1 nF E6) for STM32 ADC charge bucket sampling

.param VDD=3.3

* 3.3V Power Supply
VCC 3V3 0 DC {VDD}

* Signal generator: 20Vpp (10V peak), 1 kHz sine with AC magnitude 1 for frequency analysis
VIN IN 0 DC 0 AC 1 SIN(0 10 1k)

* Input Protection: Dual Schottky clamping diodes to 3.3V and GND
D_CLAMP_HI N1 3V3 D_SCHOTTKY
D_CLAMP_LO 0 N1 D_SCHOTTKY
.model D_SCHOTTKY D(IS=1e-7 RS=10 CJO=2p BV=40 IBV=10u)

* Attenuation and DC Bias Level Shifter Network (E12 series resistors)
* Rin provides 100k Eurorack input impedance (E12)
R1 IN N1 100k
* Pullup to 3.3V rail (E12)
R_PU 3V3 N1 27k
* Pulldown to ground (E12)
R_PD N1 0 39k

* 2nd-Order Sallen-Key Low-Pass Filter (E12 resistor, E6 capacitors)
* R2 in E12 series
R2 N1 N_INP 18k
* Feedback capacitor C1 from opamp output to summing node N1 (E6 series)
C1 OUT N1 680p
* Filter capacitor C2 from opamp non-inverting input to ground (E6 series)
C2 N_INP 0 330p

* Rail-to-Rail Single-Supply 3.3V Opamp in Unity-Gain Buffer Configuration
XU1 N_INP OUT 3V3 0 OUT RRIO_OPAMP

* STM32 ADC interface RC network (Charge reservoir and anti-aliasing pole)
R_ADC OUT ADC_IN 100
C_ADC ADC_IN 0 1n

* Rail-to-Rail Input/Output Opamp Macro-model for 3.3V Single Rail
.subckt RRIO_OPAMP INP INN VDD VSS OUT
* Differential input stage with 10 Meg input resistance
R_in INP INN 10Meg
* High-gain stage with 10 MHz gain-bandwidth product
E1 N_int 0 INP INN 100000
R_pole N_int N_flt 1k
C_pole N_flt 0 1.5915e-9
* Unity gain buffer
E_buf N_raw 0 N_flt 0 1
R_out N_raw OUT 50
* Rail clamping to VDD and VSS
D_hi OUT VDD D_RAIL
D_lo VSS OUT D_RAIL
.model D_RAIL D(IS=1e-14 RS=1)
.ends RRIO_OPAMP

.control
* AC frequency sweep from 10 Hz to 1 MHz (100 points per decade)
ac dec 100 10 1Meg
set wr_singlescale
wrdata ac_sim.txt v(ADC_IN) v(OUT) v(IN)

* Transient simulation over 5 ms (5 cycles of 1 kHz 20Vpp input)
tran 1u 5m 0 1u
set wr_singlescale
wrdata tran_sim.txt v(IN) v(OUT) v(ADC_IN) v(N1) v(N_INP)
quit
.endc

.end
